			"notes": "- 修复了苹果锄攻击力为负的问题。\n- 优化了物品提示的文本和呈现效果。\n- 删除了大熊座之爪的合成配方。\n- 熊爪工具不再能用熊皮合成。\n- 模组自带音效的敌对生物，叫声音量降低了。\n- 精灵飞蝇改成了小型生物，体型和碰撞范围都缩小了。\n- 修复了保存配置后，再次进游戏会卡在加载界面的问题。\n- 修复了配置编辑器里把数值改回默认值后保存无效的问题。\n- 移除了紫悦之星的提示文本。\n- 梅菲斯之球现在可以投掷了，命中生物会造成伤害。\n\n---\n\n- Fixed the apple hoe having negative attack damage.\n- Improved the text and presentation of item tooltips.\n- Removed the crafting recipe for the Ursa Major Claws.\n- Bear claw tools can no longer be crafted from bear pelt.\n- Lowered the voice volume of hostile mobs that use the mod's own sounds.\n- The Parasprite is now a small creature, with a much smaller model and hitbox.\n- Fixed the game getting stuck on the loading screen after saving the config.\n- Fixed the visual editor ignoring changes that reset a value back to its default.\n- Removed the tooltip from the Twilight Star.\n- The Mavis Orbs can now be thrown, dealing damage to the creatures they hit."
		},
