			"notes": "- 修改了流血状态的图标。\n- 调整了木狼和彩虹蜈蚣的刷新概率。\n- 敌对生物现在会主动攻击见到的所有生物。\n- 增加了更多的配置项目。\n- 修复某些套装给予效果时会来回闪烁的问题。\n- 给所有生物添加了动画。\n- 所有生物的声音重新配置，并且整体音量降低。\n- 大幅整理结构，重构部分代码。\n\n---\n\n- Updated the bleeding status icon.\n- Adjusted the spawn rates of Timber Wolf and Rainbow Centipede.\n- Hostile mobs now attack every living creature they see.\n- Added more configurable options.\n- Fixed the flickering issue when certain set bonuses grant effects.\n- Added animations to all mobs.\n- Reconfigured the sounds of all mobs, and lowered the overall volume.\n- Major internal restructuring and code refactoring."
