			"notes": "**ENGLISH**\n\n- Spikezilla now attacks every creature it sees.\n- The Windigo now randomly charges at its enemies.\n- Spikezilla and the Windigo now have animations.\n- The in-game visual editor no longer shows blank lines that jump around while scrolling.\n- The client config screen is now rebuilt as a two-level layout with a left pane and a right pane.\n- Fixed the apple armor recipes not working at all.\n- Fixed Prince Rutherford's loot table failing to load.\n- The Skull of Doom now attacks every creature except the undead.\n- The Skull of Doom now dives from the air to strike in melee, just like the phantom.\n- The Skull of Doom now spawns at night like zombies and skeletons, and catches fire in daylight under the open sky.\n- The Buffalo now has 35 health.\n- Fixed mod hostile mobs not spawning in open areas at night.\n- \n\n**中文**\n\n- 穗龙斯拉现在会攻击一切见到的生物。\n- 雪魔现在会随机向敌人发起冲锋。\n- 穗龙斯拉和雪魔添加了动画。\n- 游戏内可视化编辑器滚动不再出现来回跳动的空白行。\n- 客户端配置界面重构为两级 + 左右分栏。\n- 修复苹果系列护甲配方整体失效\n- 修复 Prince Rutherford 战利品表解析失败。\n- 末日颅骨现在会攻击除亡灵以外的所有生物。\n- 末日颅骨现在和幻翼一样从空中俯冲下去近战。\n- 末日颅骨现在和僵尸、骷髅一样在夜晚刷新，白天露天会被阳光点燃。\n- 野牛血量改为 35 点。\n- 修复模组敌对生物夜里在空旷处不刷新的问题。"
		},
